#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel37)
#: rc.cpp:1276 rc.cpp:1305
msgid "Regular expression to find the type of the element"
msgstr "對應元素類型的正規表示式"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:241
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, typeRxEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:281
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel37)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:241
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, typeRxEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:281
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel37)
#: rc.cpp:1279 rc.cpp:1308
msgid ""
"Regular expression to find the type of the element. The pattern is searched "
"on the result of the <i>DefinitionRx</i> match and the first captured area "
"will hold the element type.<br>\n"
"Example (simplified):<br>\n"
"<b>DefinitionRx=\\$+([a-zA-Z]+)=new\\\\s[a-zA-Z]+;<br>\n"
"TypeRx=new\\\\s([a-zA-Z]+);</b><br><br>\n"
"This will match strings like <b>$fooObj=new foo;</b>. Now this string is "
"searched and it will find <b>new foo;</b>, where <b>foo</b> is the first "
"captured text (the regular expression matching <b>foo</b> is between "
"brackets).<br>\n"
"So the type of <b>$fooObj</b> is <b>foo</b>."
msgstr ""
"對應元素類型的正規表示式。這個樣式會根據<i>定義表示式</i>得出的結果作搜尋。第"
"一次抓到的文字(captured text)會被當作元素的類型。<br>\n"
"舉一個簡單的例子：<br>\n"
"<b>定義表示式=\\$+([a-zA-Z]+)=new\\\\s[a-zA-Z]+;<br>\n"
"元素類型表示式=new\\\\s([a-zA-Z]+);</b><br><br>\n"
"這會對應到 <b>$fooObj=new foo;</b> 般的字串。然後類型表示式就會在它之內找到 "
"<b>new foo;</b>，而 <b>foo</b> 是第一次抓到的文字。(對應 <b>foo</b> 的表示式"
"正在括號之內)<br>\n"
"所以 <b>$fooObj</b> 的類型為 <b>foo</b>。"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:248
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel36)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:313
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, usageRxEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:248
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QLabel, textLabel36)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:313
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (KLineEdit, usageRxEdit)
#: rc.cpp:1287 rc.cpp:1331
msgid "Regular expression to find the usage of a group element"
msgstr "對應組別元素用法的正規表示式"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:260
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel36)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:325
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, usageRxEdit)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:260
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QLabel, textLabel36)
#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:325
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, usageRxEdit)
#: rc.cpp:1290 rc.cpp:1334
msgid ""
"Regular expression to find the usage of a group element in the document."
"<br>\n"
"Example 1:<br>\n"
"- classes are defined as  <b>class foo {...}</b><br>\n"
"- classes are used as <b>$objFoo</b><br><br>\n"
"Example 2:<br>\n"
"- variables are defined as <b>int i</b><br>\n"
"- variables are used as <b>@i</b><br><br>\n"
"Example 3:<br>\n"
"- variables are defined as <b>$i</b><br>\n"
"- variables are used as <b>$i</b>. In this case <i>UsageRx </i>is the same "
"as <i>DefinitionRx</i>."
msgstr ""
"對應文件中組別元素的用法的正規表示式。<br>\n"
"何謂用法---例子一：<br>\n"
"- 定義一個類別時使用 <b>class foo {...}</b><br>\n"
"- 以後使用類別的方法為 <b>$objFoo</b><br><br>\n"
"例子二：<br>\n"
"- 定義一個變數時使用 <b>int i</b><br>\n"
"- 以後使用變數的方法為 <b>@i</b><br><br>\n"
"例子三：<br>\n"
"- 定義一個變數時使用 <b>$i</b><br>\n"
"- 以後使用變數的方法為 <b>$i</b>。在這情況下<i>用法定義式</i>就與<i>元素定義"
"式</i>一樣"

#. i18n: file: quantacore/dialogs/dtepstructureeditdlgs.ui:263
